WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:14.643
With the help of Dr.

2
00:00:14.683 --> 00:00:18.446
Dolittle and Polynesia, Tommy understood what had happened.

3
00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:23.148
"I can't believe Luke would harm anyone, doctor," cried Tommy.

4
00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:26.630
"Nor can I, Tommy," said the doctor gravely.

5
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.432
"That's why we must go and see Luke."

6
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.281
Luke was being held in a dark, damp cell.

7
00:00:34.961 --> 00:00:38.243
Bob started to whine sadly when he saw his master.

8
00:00:41.564 --> 00:00:46.346
Dr. Dolittle called out Luke's name several times, but he didn't respond.

9
00:00:46.366 --> 00:00:49.127
"Luke!" he called again.

10
00:00:49.908 --> 00:00:51.748
Finally, Luke lifted his head.

11
00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:56.550
"We're here to help you, Luke," said the doctor.

12
00:00:57.471 --> 00:00:58.531
Luke shook his head.

13
00:00:58.551 --> 00:01:00.272
"I killed him.

14
00:01:00.684 --> 00:01:01.685
There's nothing you can do."

15
00:01:02.505 --> 00:01:05.728
Dr. Dolittle and Tommy looked at each other with concern.

16
00:01:06.748 --> 00:01:08.690
Bob began barking wildly.

17
00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.611
"That's not true!

18
00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:12.472
That's not true!"

19
00:01:14.694 --> 00:01:17.115
Dr. Dolittle knelt down beside Bob.

20
00:01:17.135 --> 00:01:19.016
"Did you see what happened?"

21
00:01:19.357 --> 00:01:19.837
he asked.

22
00:01:20.477 --> 00:01:22.179
Bob let out a loud bark.

23
00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:26.862
"Yes!" The doctor sat talking with Bob for a few minutes.

24
00:01:27.882 --> 00:01:31.433
Finally, he stood up and said, "I have a plan.

25
00:01:31.773 --> 00:01:35.236
I don't know if it's going to work, but I will do my best."

26
00:01:35.256 --> 00:01:38.178
"What for, doctor?

27
00:01:38.819 --> 00:01:41.100
No one is going to believe you," said Luke.

28
00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.002
"And the trial is about to begin."

29
00:01:43.022 --> 00:01:46.164
"But they will believe the witness," Dr.

30
00:01:46.204 --> 00:01:47.285
Dolittle assured him.

31
00:01:47.305 --> 00:01:51.648
"Witness? There were no witnesses," Luke exclaimed.

32
00:01:51.668 --> 00:01:54.070
"Yes, there was," said Dr.

33
00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.232
Dolittle. "Bob saw what happened."

34
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.181
A few hours later, Luke's trial began.

35
00:02:02.082 --> 00:02:03.762
It wasn't going well for Luke.

36
00:02:04.282 --> 00:02:06.984
The man called the prosecutor had a long nose.

37
00:02:07.604 --> 00:02:12.226
He kept pointing a finger at Luke and accusing him of many awful things.

38
00:02:12.986 --> 00:02:16.487
Then he called for a man named Mendoza to stand up.

39
00:02:19.008 --> 00:02:23.970
Mendoza explained that he, Luke, and another man named Boggs were partners.

40
00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.911
"What kind of partners?"

41
00:02:26.431 --> 00:02:27.412
asked the prosecutor.

42
00:02:28.052 --> 00:02:30.814
"We were looking for gold," Mendoza answered.

43
00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:33.755
"Finally one day, we hit it big!"

44
00:02:34.616 --> 00:02:37.757
Mendoza rubbed his hands greedily and licked his lips.

45
00:02:38.498 --> 00:02:40.219
Bob growled dangerously.

46
00:02:44.661 --> 00:02:45.342
what happened?"

47
00:02:45.822 --> 00:02:46.962
the prosecutor asked.

48
00:02:46.982 --> 00:02:52.405
"That man," Mendoza pointed to Luke, "wanted the gold for himself.

49
00:02:52.826 --> 00:02:54.006
So he killed Boggs.

50
00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:56.588
He would have killed me, but I escaped."

51
00:02:57.188 --> 00:02:59.210
Bob jumped up and barked loudly.

52
00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:02.953
"Quiet! Silence!"

53
00:03:03.594 --> 00:03:04.514
shouted the judge.

54
00:03:06.656 --> 00:03:07.917
Luke's lawyer stood up.

55
00:03:07.937 --> 00:03:10.480
"Your honor, I would like to call Dr.

56
00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.021
Dolittle." "Dr.

57
00:03:12.161 --> 00:03:14.163
Dolittle? The animal doctor?"

58
00:03:14.703 --> 00:03:16.285
the judge asked in surprise.

59
00:03:16.305 --> 00:03:19.367
"Yes, Your Honor," replied Luke's lawyer.

60
00:03:19.387 --> 00:03:23.451
"He is going to speak on behalf of the witness, Luke's dog Bob."

61
00:03:24.251 --> 00:03:27.945
At that, the courtroom exploded with loud laughter.

62
00:03:36.127 --> 00:03:38.288
Dr. Dolittle stood before the judge.

63
00:03:38.308 --> 00:03:40.948
"Can you really speak to animals?"

64
00:03:41.409 --> 00:03:42.189
the judge asked.

65
00:03:42.209 --> 00:03:45.150
"Yes, Your Honor," confirmed the doctor.

66
00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:50.271
"That's impossible," whispered some people in the courtroom.

67
00:03:50.291 --> 00:03:51.691
"He can!

68
00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:54.977
He cured my horse," said a man beside them.

69
00:03:54.997 --> 00:03:57.399
"This is an outrage!"

70
00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.261
protested the prosecutor.

71
00:04:00.222 --> 00:04:02.684
The judge sat silent for a moment or two.

72
00:04:02.704 --> 00:04:06.267
"You must prove that you can talk with animals.

73
00:04:06.767 --> 00:04:11.311
Then I will allow you to speak on behalf of Bob," he finally said.

74
00:04:11.912 --> 00:04:13.273
He motioned to a guard.

75
00:04:13.893 --> 00:04:17.016
The guard went out and came back with the judge's dog.

76
00:04:18.778 --> 00:04:21.340
The judge's dog was even bigger than Bob.

77
00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:26.042
He sat in the witness box and growled, showing sharp white teeth.

78
00:04:26.062 --> 00:04:30.265
"Now, Doctor," said the judge, "this is Sweetie."

79
00:04:30.845 --> 00:04:31.846
Everyone giggled.

80
00:04:36.828 --> 00:04:39.270
Sweetie and I know what I had for dinner last night.

81
00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.311
Ask him what I ate, Doctor."

82
00:04:43.932 --> 00:04:47.794
Dr. Dolittle approached Sweetie and began to make dog noises.

83
00:04:47.814 --> 00:04:50.376
"What on earth is he doing?"

84
00:04:51.004 --> 00:04:52.265
a large woman whispered.

85
00:04:52.285 --> 00:04:54.527
"It's a trick!

86
00:04:54.967 --> 00:04:56.668
How can a man speak to animals?"

87
00:04:57.269 --> 00:04:58.630
a man said nastily.

88
00:05:00.671 --> 00:05:03.973
Dr. Dolittle glanced at the judge and began to giggle.

89
00:05:04.674 --> 00:05:06.595
He continued talking with Sweetie.

90
00:05:06.615 --> 00:05:08.777
"What's taking so long?"

91
00:05:09.197 --> 00:05:10.838
the judge asked impatiently.

92
00:05:10.858 --> 00:05:12.740
"Oh, sorry, Your Honor.

93
00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:18.404
Sweetie was telling me what you did after supper," chuckled the doctor.

94
00:05:20.644 --> 00:05:23.005
"Never mind that," the judge snapped.

95
00:05:23.425 --> 00:05:24.846
"What did I have for dinner?"

96
00:05:25.726 --> 00:05:31.848
"You had lamb chops, potatoes, and a glass of wine," the doctor smiled, "and then you left the

97
00:05:31.888 --> 00:05:35.369
house and The judge's eyes grew very wide.

98
00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:39.051
Interrupting, he said quickly, "Very well.

99
00:05:39.491 --> 00:05:41.071
Bob is allowed as a witness."
